### 10. Monitoring Checklist for 5 TB+ Production

| # | What to Monitor | How | Alert Threshold |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | **Row count reconciliation** (bronze vs silver vs gold) | SQL: `count(*)` per layer per day | >1% drift |
| 2 | **File count per table** | `DESCRIBE DETAIL table` → `numFiles` | >50K files |
| 3 | **Avg file size** | `DESCRIBE DETAIL` → `sizeInBytes / numFiles` | <32 MB or >2 GB |
| 4 | **Spill to disk** | Query Profile → spill metrics | Any spill > 1 GB |
| 5 | **Stage duration trend** | Job run history → task durations over time | >20% regression week-over-week |
| 6 | **Streaming lag** | Structured Streaming metrics → `inputRowsPerSecond` vs `processedRowsPerSecond` | processedRate < inputRate for >30 min |
| 7 | **CDF backlog** | Watermark version vs latest table version | Lag > 24 hours |
| 8 | **OPTIMIZE status** | `DESCRIBE HISTORY` → last OPTIMIZE timestamp | >14 days since last OPTIMIZE |
| 9 | **VACUUM status** | `DESCRIBE HISTORY` → last VACUUM | >30 days since last VACUUM |
| 10 | **Data freshness** | `MAX(ingestion_timestamp)` per table | Stale > SLA window |

